    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d31ab131a39e40f4a513702dc628164c",
      "statement": "newOauth generates a 32-char alphanumeric state, a 64-char alphanumeric PKCE verifier, and a 256-bit hex nonce (with --email as login_hint); unknown providers are resolved by GET <provider>/.well-known/openid-configuration (OIDC path form, with a TODO about RFC 8414), requiring authorization_endpoint plus token_endpoint for normal flows and device_authorization_endpoint plus token_endpoint for the device flow.",
      "evidence": [
