      "id": "claim_eed5f9b9102d4c0891d1411328f5ebaa",
      "statement": "The callback ServeHTTP serves only the configured path (default /), answers OPTIONS, rejects error params, requires both code and state with the state validated against the generated value, exchanges the code, honors --redirect-url with a 302 redirect after success (the team-bootstrap SSO redirect mechanism), otherwise renders a success page, and delivers the token over the channel.",
      "evidence": [
