      "id": "claim_420f061b619d43548166d46f2bcf8b32",
      "statement": "For OIDC provisioners, the CA commands run 'step oauth --oidc --bare --provider <ConfigurationEndpoint> --client-id ... --client-secret ...' as a subprocess via exec.Step, appending provisioner scopes, auth-params, an optional --console, and --listen <ListenAddress> when STEP_LISTEN is unset, and use the printed ID token as the CA authorization token.",
